{"id":"kydele","name":"Kydele","type":"character","aliases":["Kydele, prophet of Kruphix","the oracle","the Oracle of Kruphix"],"description":"Prophet of Kruphix who bears the burden of knowing.","pages":5,"first_seen":"2014-04-02","last_seen":"2016-11-11","description_citations":[{"source":"card-text","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Commander 2016: card flavor text","series":"Commander 2016","authors":[],"date":"2016-11-11","url":"https://scryfall.com/sets/c16","link":"https://scryfall.com/sets/c16","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"Commander 2016: card flavor text (Commander 2016, 2016), flavor text. Wizards of the Coast."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"uncharted-realms-theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02-e12","era":null,"summary":"Xenagos interrogates the oracle Kydele about the hydra, how to reach Nyx, and the edge of the world; she replies in riddles.","participants":["xenagos","kydele","kruphix","polukranos"],"location":"skola-valley","importance":"major","page":"archive/uncharted-realms-theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02","order":439,"story_date":"2014-04-02","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":69,"quote":"\"Is the hydra truly wandering among mortals?\" Xenagos asked.","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160704111453/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02#:~:text=%22Is%20the%20hydra%20truly,among%20mortals%3F%22%20Xenagos%20asked.","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Theros eBook Godsend , Part 1: Sample Chapter","series":"Uncharted Realms","authors":[],"date":"2014-04-02","url":"http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160704111453/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02#:~:text=%22Is%20the%20hydra%20truly,among%20mortals%3F%22%20Xenagos%20asked.","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160704111453/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02","license":null,"text":"\"Theros eBook Godsend , Part 1: Sample Chapter\". Uncharted Realms, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2014. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"uncharted-realms-theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02-e13","era":null,"summary":"Kydele warns that the gods know something is amiss and that soon everyone will know Xenagos's name.","participants":["kydele","xenagos"],"location":"skola-valley","importance":"major","page":"archive/uncharted-realms-theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02","order":439,"story_date":"2014-04-02","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":84,"quote":"\"Soon everyone will know your name,\" she said.","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160704111453/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02#:~:text=%22Soon%20everyone%20will%20know%20your%20name%2C%22%20she%20said.","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Theros eBook Godsend , Part 1: Sample Chapter","series":"Uncharted Realms","authors":[],"date":"2014-04-02","url":"http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160704111453/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02#:~:text=%22Soon%20everyone%20will%20know%20your%20name%2C%22%20she%20said.","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160704111453/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02","license":null,"text":"\"Theros eBook Godsend , Part 1: Sample Chapter\". Uncharted Realms, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2014. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"uncharted-realms-theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02-e14","era":null,"summary":"Kydele helps Deiphon's soul pass to the Underworld and thanks Keranos for the lightning.","participants":["kydele","deiphon","keranos","underworld"],"location":"skola-valley","importance":"minor","page":"archive/uncharted-realms-theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02","order":439,"story_date":"2014-04-02","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":86,"quote":"\"Thank you for the lightning, Keranos,\" the oracle said to the sky.","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160704111453/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02#:~:text=%22Thank%20you%20for%20the,said%20to%20the%20sky.","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Theros eBook Godsend , Part 1: Sample Chapter","series":"Uncharted Realms","authors":[],"date":"2014-04-02","url":"http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160704111453/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02#:~:text=%22Thank%20you%20for%20the,said%20to%20the%20sky.","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160704111453/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02","license":null,"text":"\"Theros eBook Godsend , Part 1: Sample Chapter\". Uncharted Realms, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2014. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"uncharted-realms-theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02-e15","era":null,"summary":"Xenagos, weakened, lets Kydele transform into mist and escape toward Kruphix's Tree.","participants":["kydele","xenagos","kruphix-s-tree"],"location":"skola-valley","importance":"major","page":"archive/uncharted-realms-theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02","order":439,"story_date":"2014-04-02","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":87,"quote":"so he did nothing as Kydele transformed into mist and vanished through the gap in the vine-roof","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160704111453/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02#:~:text=so%20he%20did%20nothing,gap%20in%20the%20vine%2Droof","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Theros eBook Godsend , Part 1: Sample Chapter","series":"Uncharted Realms","authors":[],"date":"2014-04-02","url":"http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160704111453/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02#:~:text=so%20he%20did%20nothing,gap%20in%20the%20vine%2Droof","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160704111453/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/theros-ebook-godsend-part-1-sample-chapter-2014-04-02","license":null,"text":"\"Theros eBook Godsend , Part 1: Sample Chapter\". Uncharted Realms, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2014. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e0","era":null,"summary":"Diantha brings the Oracle of Kruphix her meal in Meletis and the oracle says Kruphix once spirited her away to his true temple.","participants":["diantha","kydele","kruphix","meletis"],"location":"meletis","importance":"minor","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":453,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":15,"quote":"When I was in danger, Kruphix spirited me away to his temple.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=When%20I%20was%20in,away%20to%20his%20temple.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=When%20I%20was%20in,away%20to%20his%20temple.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e1","era":null,"summary":"Flashback: from Kruphix's Temple, Kydele watches Xenagos become a god and Elspeth, with Ajani, use Godsend to cut him from the sky.","participants":["kydele","xenagos","elspeth-tirel","ajani-goldmane","godsend"],"location":"nyx","importance":"major","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":453,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":28,"quote":"She saw Elspeth use the blade called Godsend to cut Xenagos from the sky.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=She%20saw%20Elspeth%20use,Xenagos%20from%20the%20sky.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=She%20saw%20Elspeth%20use,Xenagos%20from%20the%20sky.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e2","era":null,"summary":"Flashback: Heliod snatches Godsend from Elspeth and murders her with it, claiming a champion cannot know more than her god.","participants":["heliod","elspeth-tirel","godsend","kydele"],"location":"nyx","importance":"major","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":453,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":31,"quote":"And then he murdered her, his own champion, with her own weapon.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=And%20then%20he%20murdered,with%20her%20own%20weapon.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=And%20then%20he%20murdered,with%20her%20own%20weapon.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e3","era":null,"summary":"Kydele feels dead inside and finds that Kruphix, who had spoken to her constantly, has fallen silent since Heliod's betrayal.","participants":["kydele","kruphix"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"minor","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":453,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":35,"quote":"But since Heliod's act of betrayal, the voice of her god had fallen silent.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=But%20since%20Heliod%27s%20act,god%20had%20fallen%20silent.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=But%20since%20Heliod%27s%20act,god%20had%20fallen%20silent.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e4","era":null,"summary":"Kruphix speaks to Kydele, who asks whether what happened was good and why it feels wrong.","participants":["kydele","kruphix"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"minor","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":453,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":48,"quote":"does it all feel so wrong?","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=does%20it%20all%20feel%20so%20wrong%3F","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=does%20it%20all%20feel%20so%20wrong%3F","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e5","era":null,"summary":"Kruphix tells Kydele that the gods are beliefs that took form in Nyx, that Heliod was not always the sun god and that gods depend on mortals believing they are unchanging.","participants":["kruphix","kydele","heliod"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"major","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":453,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":54,"quote":"The gods are beliefs that took form within the fabric of Nyx.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=The%20gods%20are%20beliefs,the%20fabric%20of%20Nyx.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=The%20gods%20are%20beliefs,the%20fabric%20of%20Nyx.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e6","era":null,"summary":"Kruphix warns her that knowledge is cruel; Kydele insists she wants to know, and they walk to the edge of the world.","participants":["kruphix","kydele"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"minor","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":453,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":92,"quote":"they came to the edge of the world itself","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=they%20came%20to%20the,of%20the%20world%20itself","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=they%20came%20to%20the,of%20the%20world%20itself","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e7","era":null,"summary":"Kruphix reveals that Theros is one of many worlds and that world-walkers like Elspeth, Ajani, Kiora and Xenagos have walked between them.","participants":["kruphix","kydele","elspeth-tirel","ajani-goldmane","kiora","xenagos"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"major","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":453,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":105,"quote":"So was the triton—the merfolk—Kiora, who called herself Callaphe and earned the ire of Thassa.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=So%20was%20the%20triton%E2%80%94the,the%20ire%20of%20Thassa.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=So%20was%20the%20triton%E2%80%94the,the%20ire%20of%20Thassa.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e8","era":null,"summary":"Kruphix explains that Xenagos traveled to godless worlds and tried to show everyone the gods were a lie, but people saw only chaos and he threatened nothing.","participants":["kruphix","kydele","xenagos"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"minor","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":453,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":109,"quote":"decided everyone on Theros should know the gods were a lie.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=decided%20everyone%20on%20Theros,gods%20were%20a%20lie.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=decided%20everyone%20on%20Theros,gods%20were%20a%20lie.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e9","era":null,"summary":"Kruphix reveals his fear: threats from the Eldrazi, an ancient dragon planeswalker and Phyrexia could destroy Theros while even the gods are powerless.","participants":["kruphix","kydele","kiora","ajani-goldmane","elspeth-tirel","eldrazi","phyrexia"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"major","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":453,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":125,"quote":"even the gods may be powerless to stop them.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=even%20the%20gods%20may,powerless%20to%20stop%20them.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=even%20the%20gods%20may,powerless%20to%20stop%20them.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e10","era":null,"summary":"Back in Meletis, the oracle tells Diantha she learned nothing to share, and gazes into the distance.","participants":["kydele","diantha"],"location":"meletis","importance":"minor","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":453,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":131,"quote":"There is nothing. Nothing at all.","link":"h